### Admin Login
@name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Get Current User (Bearer auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
